title: Campaign
subtitle: Meetings, rallies and the unions: one campaign on a matter that reaches several groups at once.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.partyReady(Q) && Q.S.chapter.status !== 'ended' !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.campaign (Z — 0.77, decisions of 8 X 2026): five campaigns on a matter, each over its own groups, through
// meetings, rallies and the unions; rallies before an election in the last three months before the vote. One option, 1 T and
// 1 R. The direction and the character of the party and the state of the country strengthen a campaign; they do not choose it.
// The card rests three months after use (Z — 0.76).
PolishParty.campaignView(Q);
!}

= Campaign

Meetings, rallies and the unions. Each campaign costs 1 resource and reaches several groups at once; the numbers are the expected change of PPS support in points. [+ pl_campaign_line +] Party money: [+ pl_party_cash +].

- @eight_hours
- @prices
- @land
- @republic
- @unemployed
- @rallies
- @easy_discard

@eight_hours
title: In defence of the eight-hour day
subtitle: [+ pl_issue_eight_hours_effect +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.issueCampaignStatus(Q, 'eight_hours').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_issue_eight_hours_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.issueCampaign(Q, 'eight_hours');
!}
go-to: result

@prices
title: Against high prices: wages must keep up with prices
subtitle: [+ pl_issue_prices_effect +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.issueCampaignStatus(Q, 'prices').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_issue_prices_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.issueCampaign(Q, 'prices');
!}
go-to: result

@land
title: Land for the peasants
subtitle: [+ pl_issue_land_effect +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.issueCampaignStatus(Q, 'land').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_issue_land_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.issueCampaign(Q, 'land');
!}
go-to: result

@republic
title: In defence of the Republic
subtitle: [+ pl_issue_republic_effect +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.issueCampaignStatus(Q, 'republic').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_issue_republic_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.issueCampaign(Q, 'republic');
