@rallies
title: Rallies before the election
subtitle: 1 resource. More of our voters go to the polls: the turnout of [+ pl_rally_groups +] rises by 0.04 until the vote.
view-if: pl_rally_open = 1
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.rallyStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_rally_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.electionRallies(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Campaign

[+ pl_party_result +]

